sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant S as ScanSnapshotController<br/>ScanPhotoService
  participant V as api/scan-snapshot.js<br/>(Vercel)
  participant F as Firestore
  participant G as Gemini (vision + search)
  actor A as Admin (Pending Snapshot Reviews)
  U->>S: Take one photo (catalogue miss)
  S->>S: JPEG under 80 KB, no EXIF, button locked
  S->>V: photo + Firebase ID token
  V->>V: accounts:lookup (real, enabled user)
  V->>F: snapshot_quota uid_day +1, all_day +1 (user's token)
  V->>G: read brand, name, kind, shade, list
  G-->>V: fields + source pages
  V-->>S: reading, label Pending approval
  S->>F: pending_products/snap_brand__name__uid + image doc
  S-->>U: result with PENDING APPROVAL badge
  A->>F: approve (brand, product, new ingredients ai_) or reject (delete)
